    <sec id="Sec1" sec-type="intro">
      <title>Introduction</title>
      <p>Egg weight has been studied extensively [<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="CR1">1</xref>, <xref ref-type="bibr" rid="CR2">2</xref>–<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="CR3">3</xref>]. Earlier work (<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="CR4">Wang et al. 2020</xref>) used pedigree BLUP. See also <xref ref-type="bibr" rid="CR1 CR2">1,2</xref>.</p>
      <p>Prices were up 5% and costs were $3 per hen; gene_name stays intact.</p>
    </sec>
